cgame\u201d of constitutionality while their opponents will just flip the board over once taking power.", "author": "lefty295", "created": 1794449526957, "profile_picture": "NWbNd6AomP4v", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "MuhDick", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "There\u2019s a time limit on the constitution.", "last_comment_created": 1794454706345, "content": "<p>Once democrats take control of the Supreme Court, there is no Constitution. It does not matter what the paper says at all. It goes from a limit on the government, to a motivating reason for the government to get more involved in your life at all levels. It will go from \u201c2A is the right to keep and bear arms that government cannot infringe\u201d to \u201cyou\u2019re not in a militia and to uphold the Constitution we need to seize your arms\u201d. Or \u201cyou have freedom of speech that the government cannot infringe\u201d to \u201cwe must stop your speech because your horrible ideas incite violence and keep others from expressing their free speech\u201d. The current SCOTUS is not equipped to handle the times we are in. They will continue to play the \u201cgame\u201d of constitutionality while their opponents will just flip the board over once taking power.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 9, "score_up": 27, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}